{"unit_id":"v587d__capital-generation#card-zh","repo":"v587d/capital-generation","commit":"a31a8da8e99aaac21a1fb179302ba7ce258ea36b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Capital Generation 是面向 A 股、港股与美股研究者的 DSH 投研插件，组合数据采集、资料检索和多 Agent 工作流。它注册行情专家、自动模式与资讯专员等角色及配套工具，可查询行情和财务数据、检索公告新闻、分析当前会话数据、解析 PDF/图片并生成可交互图表。另含自选股管理、精选研究方法和定时投研任务面板，适合需要将取数、核验和报告整理放在同一 DSH 会话中的投资研究场景。需安装 DSH；第三方数据源密钥按需配置，未配置时对应能力不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-52","preset/capital-generation/agent.patch.yml:15-23","lib/index.js:103-157","lib/data-collector/tools.js:127-167","lib/web-retriever/tools.js:130-205","lib/chart/tool.js:303-331","watchlist/index.js:1013-1074","automation/index.js:158-212"]}
{"unit_id":"v587d__capital-generation#card-en","repo":"v587d/capital-generation","commit":"a31a8da8e99aaac21a1fb179302ba7ce258ea36b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Capital Generation is a DSH research plugin for A-share, Hong Kong, and US markets. It combines market data, web search, dataset analysis, PDF/image OCR, and interactive charts in agent workflows. It also offers watchlists and scheduled research tasks. Install DSH; provider credentials are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-52","preset/capital-generation/agent.patch.yml:15-23","lib/index.js:103-157","lib/data-collector/tools.js:127-167","lib/web-retriever/tools.js:130-205","lib/chart/tool.js:303-331","watchlist/index.js:1013-1074","automation/index.js:158-212"]}
